                   MEDITATIONS ON HEALING AND HEALTH

Preface

Prov 4:20-22 says, ‘‘my son, give attention to my words;
incline your ear to my sayings . . . for they are life to those
who find them, and health to all their flesh.’’ The Word of
God is life and health. The word translated health in this
scripture also means ‘medicine’, ‘cure’ and
‘wholesomeness’. This means that the Word of God is the
spiritual panacea that cures all and every sickness. So, is
there is need for healing, the Word of God is medicine
enough, it is surgery enough and it is immunity enough
for all and every kind of sickness. Furthermore, the word
of God is not just for healing; it is for health. The daily
ingestion of the Word through the mouth-gate of your
spirit is all you need to walk in perpetual health and
enjoy the God-kind of life and health. These scriptures
are to be daily and consistently declared as your health
and healing assurance scheme. They are to be spoken
intentionally and with vital connection between your
health and your mouth. Find a suitable atmosphere and
engage effectively, repeatedly, continually and routinely.
It takes time for the things of the spirit to crystalise so
the health and life benefit of these meditations will
become tangible in your lives after a length of time of
use.
