I obey the word of the Lord my God and do what is
right in His sight, and give ear to His commandments
and keep all His statutes. God does not allow any
disease to come on me which is present in the world for
He is the Lord who heals me. (Ex. 15:26 NIV)

I serve the Lord my God. He blesses what I eat and
drink. He takes sickness away from the midst of me and
my loved ones. No one is barren or miscarries among
my people. God fulfills the number of my days in long
life. (Ex 23:25-26 NKJV)

I declare that I live in obedience to the word of the
Lord. I walk in all the ways which the Lord my God has
commanded me. I live - I prolong my days in the
inheritance He has given me. (Deut. 5:33 Paraphrased)

The Lord loves, blesses and multiplies me. He blesses
my children and my produce/possessions in the land of
the living. I am blessed above all nations;
