I (Insert Name) am an hundred and twenty years old
when I die: my eyes are not dim, nor is my natural
strength abated. (Deut 34:7 KJV Paraphrased)

God guards all my bones and not one of them is
broken. (Ps. 34:20 KJV)

The Lord sustains me from the sickbed; when in
illness, He restores me to full health.
(Psalm 41:3 NKJV)

The Lord is my light and my salvation (and my
health), I fear nothing. The Lord is the strength of
