I give attention to God’s Word and incline my ear to
His sayings. I do not let them depart from my eyes but
keep them in the midst of my heart for they are life to
me and health to my body. (Prov. 4:20-22 KJV)

I fear the Lord and I prolong my days. I keep my heart
with all diligence for out of it springs the issues of life.
(Prov. 10:27; 4:23 KJV Paraphrased)

I speak pleasant words always and they are as
honeycomb; they are sweetness to my soul and health
