About the Book

The Word of God is the source of life and health. Thus, the
outflow of the Word of health from the heart through the
mouth will heal all and every sickness. Furthermore, the word
of God is not just for healing; it is for health. Thus, the continual
ingestion of the word of God and its expression through your
mouth is sufficient for you to live in perpetual health and enjoy
the God-kind of life. This book contains scriptures on health,
healing and longevity so that you can sow them daily into the
soil of your life and body thereby reaping a rich harvest of
health, vitality and long-life.

                  About the Author

                                Davids Oluwaseye Ayodele is a trainer,
                                speaker and writer. He is graced with
                                understanding and presenting complex
                                issues with simplicity and clarity for
                                practical application.

  He is the founder of several initiatives both within the
  Church and the workplace, such as The Wisdom Institute of
  Leadership and Ministry for training and equipping ministry
  leaders, ENABLED Multiconcept for business and professional
  leadership development and consultancy, as well as several
  other platforms for Bible-based teaching ministry. He has a
  bachelor’s degree in chemical engineering and master’s
  degree in engineering management from Ahmadu Bello
  University, Nigeria. He is married to Deborah OluwaNifemi
  and they are blessed with children.

